A lazy colon-shaped line in a quote paragraph keeps no indentation

```
> :  d
   :  b
.
<blockquote><p>:  d
:  b</p></blockquote>
```

```
> - :: t
> :  d
   :  b
.
<blockquote>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <dl>
        <dt>t</dt>
      </dl>
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>:  d
:  b</p>
</blockquote>
```

```
> :  d
      :  b
.
<blockquote><p>:  d
:  b</p></blockquote>
```
